    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, but it doesn't really feel like anything is growing. it just feels like a heavy silence. like i'm watching a movie of someone else's life and i'm not even in the cast anymore. does it ever actually get better, or is this just what happens when you lose everything that made you \"you\"?",
