      "content": "it just feels like so much work to wait for a \"new self\" that might never even show up. i'm just so tired of trying to find meaning in a life that feels completely hollow. sometimes i think the only thing left to do is just accept that the role is over and let it go. it would be so much easier to just stop fighting it all.",
